      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LOUIS.\nWell, keep good quarter and good care tonight.\nThe day shall not be up so soon as I,\nTo try the fair adventure of tomorrow.",
